        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>浙江大学报 — 求是苑·剪影 — 在军训中磨砺青春</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 1280px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 10px 18px 6px 18px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  /* ============ Masthead ============ */\n  .masthead {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #000;\n    padding-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .pagenum {\n    width: 42px; height: 46px;\n    background: #b8b8b8;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 46px;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .section-name {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #c00000;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    margin-left: 22px;\n    padding-right: 26px;\n    line-height: 46px;\n    font-family: \"SimHei\",\"Heiti SC\",sans-serif;\n  }\n  .mast-mid {\n    border-left: 1px solid #000;\n    padding-left: 22px;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .mast-mid .date { letter-spacing: 2px; }\n  .mast-mid .date .week { margin-left: 30px; }\n  .mast-mid .editor { margin-top: 2px; }\n  .mast-mid .editor .tel { margin-left: 18px; }\n  .logo {\n    text-align: right;\n    padding-right: 4px;\n  }\n  .logo .cn {\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #c00000;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\",\"STKaiti\",serif;\n    font-style: italic;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .logo .en {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #c00000;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n\n  /* ============ Top photo strip ============ */\n  .strip {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 8px;\n    margin-top: 14px;\n    padding: 0 90px;\n  }\n  .strip .cell { flex: 1; }\n  .strip .cap {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    background: #dcdcdc;\n    border: 1px solid #b5b5b5;\n    color: #555;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 4px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .strip .placeholder { height: 155px; }\n\n  /* ============ Headline ============ */\n  .headline {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 34px;\n  }\n  .headline h1 {\n    font-size: 66px;\n    margin: 0;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    font-family: \"SimHei\",\"Heiti SC\",sans-serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .headline .sub {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    margin-top: 12px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    font-family: \"SimHei\",\"Heiti SC\",sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  /* ============ Main body layout ============ */\n  .main {\n    display: flex;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n    gap: 20px;\n  }\n  .col-left { width: 505px; }\n  .col-mid  { width: 260px; }\n  .col-right{ width: 435px; }\n\n  .cap-right { text-align: right; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.7; }\n  .cap-left  { text-align: left;  font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.7; }\n  .cap-center{ text-align: center;font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.7; }\n\n  .big-photo .placeholder { height: 500px; }\n  .cap-big {\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    text-align: left;\n    padding-left: 300px;\n  }\n\n  /* left lower block: caption left of photo */\n  .lowleft-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-top: 40px;\n  }\n  .lowleft-row .lbl {\n    width: 110px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    text-align: left;\n    padding-top: 90px;\n    padding-right: 8px;\n  }\n  .lowleft-row .pic { flex: 1; }\n  .lowleft-row .pic .placeholder { height: 245px; }\n  .lowleft-row.tall .pic .placeholder { height: 280px; }\n  .lowleft-row.tug .pic .placeholder { height: 210px; }\n\n  /* ============ Article text ============ */\n  .article {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.72;\n    text-align: justify;\n    letter-spacing: 0.2px;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n  }\n  .article p { margin: 0; text-indent: 2em; }\n  .byline {\n    text-align: right;\n    margin-top: 18px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n\n  /* QR block */\n  .qr-block {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n    margin-top: 60px;\n  }\n  .qr-block .qr {\n    width: 92px; height: 92px;\n  }\n  .qr-block .qr-text {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n  }\n\n  /* right column */\n  .col-right .placeholder.r1 { height: 275px; }\n  .col-right .placeholder.r2 { height: 540px; }\n  .col-right .placeholder.r3 { height: 330px; }\n  .col-right .cap { font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.7; margin-top: 8px; }\n  .col-right .blk { margin-bottom: 40px; }\n\n  /* ============ Footer ============ */\n  .footer {\n    border-top: 1px solid #000;\n    margin-top: 26px;\n    padding-top: 6px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- Masthead -->\n  <div class=\"masthead\">\n    <div class=\"pagenum\">4</div>\n    <div class=\"section-name\">求是苑·剪影</div>\n    <div class=\"mast-mid\">\n      <div class=\"date\">2018 年 9 月 14 日<span class=\"week\">星期五</span></div>\n      <div class=\"editor\">责任编辑：张&nbsp;岚<span class=\"tel\">联系电话：0571-88981339</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"logo\">\n      <div class=\"cn\">浙江大学报</div>\n      <div class=\"en\">ZHE JIANG DA XUE BAO</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Top photo strip -->\n  <div class=\"strip\">\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"cap\">汗水流过坚毅的脸庞<br>陈佳轩&nbsp;&nbsp;摄</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 军训学员头戴迷彩帽特写]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"cap\">挥旗<br>施良辰&nbsp;&nbsp;摄</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 学生挥动红旗]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"cap\">别担心，我不累<br>梁汉卿&nbsp;&nbsp;摄</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 迷彩服学员微笑交谈]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"cap\">关怀<br>何念泽&nbsp;&nbsp;摄</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 教官关怀蹲地学员]</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Headline -->\n  <div class=\"headline\">\n    <h1>在军训中磨砺青春</h1>\n    <div class=\"sub\">——浙江大学 2018 年学生军训掠影</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Main content -->\n  <div class=\"main\">\n\n    <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col-left\">\n      <div class=\"big-photo\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 走廊内两列学员练习军姿，教官居中行走]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cap-big\">在校园的每个角落练习着<br>军姿<br><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding-left:80px;\">陈佳轩&nbsp;&nbsp;摄</span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"lowleft-row\">\n        <div class=\"lbl\">用一场合唱<br>比赛铭记这些闪<br>亮的日子<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;胡琪宣&nbsp;&nbsp;摄</div>\n        <div class=\"pic\"><div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 学员方阵与大鼓合唱]</div></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"lowleft-row tall\">\n        <div class=\"lbl\">用一份入党<br>申请书见证理想<br>与信念<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;胡琪宣&nbsp;&nbsp;摄</div>\n        <div class=\"pic\"><div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 学员书写材料，教官旁立]</div></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"lowleft-row tug\">\n        <div class=\"lbl\">用一场拔河<br>比赛演绎青春的<br>力量<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;陈佳轩&nbsp;&nbsp;摄</div>\n        <div class=\"pic\"><div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 学生拔河比赛]</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- MIDDLE COLUMN (article) -->\n    <div class=\"col-mid\">\n      <div class=\"article\">\n        <p>紫金港，你五点钟的晨曦真美。</p>\n        <p>见过早晨五点钟的校园吗？柔亮的光里忽地划出几声嘹亮的口号，然后映出大团的绿，不同于大自然肆意的绿色，那是一种属于军人的——规矩的绿！军装整齐、步伐一致、口号嘹亮，浙大的新人们迎来了他们军训的一天。</p>\n        <p>谁言书生只善文，军训场上显神威！既怀得鲲鹏之志，岂能无钢铁之躯？壮志凌云，跃跃欲试；意气风发，摩拳擦掌。能文善武，成大国之器；握笔挥刀，铸全能之材！</p>\n        <p>紫金港，你日光下汗浸衣襟的战士们真帅。</p>\n        <p>\"向左转！向右转！\"\"齐步走！\"一遍两遍，百遍千遍。不骄不惧，不悔不怕。浙大人不怕苦，浙大人要磨炼钢铁意志！心中有理想，脚下有力量。目光坚定，我们向往成为钢铁一般的战士，故我们忍耐，我们奋发，至刚至坚，长空亮剑，气贯云天！</p>\n        <p>烈日炎炎，烙不了心中激情；汗水涔涔，带不走崇高信念。青春年华，用汗水诠释；前路漫漫，用血泪征服！</p>\n        <p>宣父犹能畏后生，丈夫未可轻年少！不屈——不屈——！</p>\n        <p>紫金港，你夕阳里的藕舫路真好看。</p>\n        <p>屈原道：\"路漫漫其修远兮，吾将上下而求索。\"竺老校长二问犹然在耳，唯有向前，全力以赴，才可不负重托。前人栽树，竺老同众多浙大的学长学姐一起，为我们守护着这方生机盎然的土地。战火中的西迁故事，林俊德院士的事迹……既传达了力量，更是我们的榜样！传承的重任在肩，要传承的是一代代浙大人艰苦创业的精神，要传承的是一代代浙大人求是创新的灵魂！</p>\n        <p>紫金港，你路灯下的湖水轻轻泛起涟漪，你黑暗中的荷枝柔柔地扭动腰肢，你月牙楼边传来的歌声微微回响。</p>\n        <p>这一天了了，战士们都进入梦乡。</p>\n        <p>紫金港，你今天真好看。我想，明天的你一定更加美丽！</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"byline\">本版文字&nbsp;&nbsp;包蓉&nbsp;&nbsp;杨萝萝</div>\n\n      <div class=\"qr-block\">\n        <div class=\"qr placeholder\" style=\"height:92px;width:92px;\">[QR码]</div>\n        <div class=\"qr-text\">用手机QQ<br>扫二维码<br>加入浙江大学<br>QQ智慧校园</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col-right\">\n      <div class=\"blk\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder r1\">[Photo: 学员持地图在校园道路奔跑]</div>\n        <div class=\"cap\">在定向越野中奋力奔跑<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;陈佳轩&nbsp;&nbsp;摄</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"blk\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder r2\">[Photo: 逆光篮球场上蹲地的学员与影子]</div>\n        <div class=\"cap\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;一排男生站成一列，用<br>自己的影子给姑娘挡住烈日</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"blk\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder r3\">[Photo: 俯拍大规模迷彩方阵行进]</div>\n        <div class=\"cap\">迷彩的颜色是今夏紫金<br>港最靓丽的风景线<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;陈佳轩&nbsp;&nbsp;摄</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div>本报通讯地址：浙江大学紫金港校区东三 105&nbsp;&nbsp;《浙江大学报》编辑部&nbsp;&nbsp;邮编：310058&nbsp;&nbsp;电子信箱:zdxb@zju.edu.cn&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;电话:0571-88981339&nbsp;&nbsp;88273707&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;总编：应&nbsp;飚&nbsp;&nbsp;副总编：章&nbsp;曼&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;电子编辑：李岑&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;承印：新华通讯社浙江分社印刷厂</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
